{
  "case_id": "PER-BL-USB-001",
  "case_name": "Peripheral Policy Tab Restore Entry",
  "module": "peripheral",
  "flow": [
    {
      "name": "launch_app",
      "ref": "app.launch",
      "params": {
        "timeout_sec": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "open_peripheral_manage",
      "ref": "navigation.open_page",
      "params": {
        "page_id": "peripheral-manage"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "open_peripheral_policy_tab",
      "ref": "ui.click_text",
      "params": {
        "text": "黑白名单",
        "bundle_name": "{{bundle_name}}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "assertions": [
    {
      "name": "peripheral_policy_restore_visible",
      "type": "assert_text_presence",
      "value": "还原策略",
      "level": "primary",
      "params": {
        "bundle_name": "{{bundle_name}}",
        "present": true,
        "timeout_ms": 2000,
        "interval_ms": 250
      }
    }
  ],
  "result_policy": {
    "allow_unknown": true,
    "stop_on_failure": true
  },
  "notes": [
    "当前版本在“黑白名单”页工具栏提供策略还原入口。",
    "覆盖边界：本用例只证明黑白名单页和“还原策略”入口可达，不证明默认 deny、设备级禁止下发或策略还原事务已经完成。",
    "完整黑名单场景还需要准备一台无历史指纹的真实 USB 设备，设置默认策略为 deny 后插入，核对 desired_policy=deny、active_policy=deny、present=true，再执行还原并回读 EDM 与本地状态。"
  ]
}
